    {
      "source": "If the method parameter is of type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> it will be resolved by\n<a href=\"MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.method.annotation\"><code>MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> instead unless the annotation\nspecifies a name in which case it is considered to be a single attribute of\ntype map (vs multiple attributes collected in a map).",
      "translation": "如果方法参数的类型为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，它将由<a href=\"MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.method.annotation\"><code>MatrixVariableMapMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>解析，除非注解指定了名称，在这种情况下，它被视为类型为 map 的单个属性（而不是在 map 中收集的多个属性）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Actually resolve the value synchronously.",
      "translation": "实际上同步解析该值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether this resolver supports the given method parameter.",
      "translation": "该解析器是否支持给定的方法参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create the <a href=\"AbstractNamedValueArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.method.annotation\"><code>AbstractNamedValueArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo</code></a> object for the given method parameter.\nImplementations typically retrieve the method annotation by means of\n<a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html#getParameterAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodParameter.getParameterAnnotation(Class)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的方法参数创建 <a href=\"AbstractNamedValueArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive.result.method.annotation\"><code>AbstractNamedValueArgumentResolver.NamedValueInfo</code></a> 对象。实现通常通过 <a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html#getParameterAnnotation(java.lang.Class)\"><code>MethodParameter.getParameterAnnotation(Class)</code></a> 获取方法注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
